3584	AssessmentItemAPIPTemplateDeclarationXML	AssessmentItemAPIPTemplateDeclarationXML	Template declarations declare item variables that are to be used specifically for the purposes of cloning items. They can have their value set only during template processing. They are referred to within the item body in order to individualize the clone and possibly also within the response Processing rules if the cloning process affects the way the item is scored.  The XML from the IMS Global APIP Specification would be included.	\N	4	string	\N	\N	\N	CEDS v14	textFormat Alphanumeric	\N	\N	\N	\N	LIF	f	\N	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	Public	f	f
